# SYNTHETIC — hand-written from RFC 1939, RFC 5034 and RFC 4616, not a recording.
# The phase-0 capture against a real server has not happened yet.
# AUTH PLAIN carries an initial response: base64 of NUL student NUL s3cret.
# The fixture password is the literal s3cret. It is not a credential.

S: +OK POP3 server ready
C: AUTH PLAIN AHN0dWRlbnQAczNjcmV0
S: +OK authenticated
C: QUIT
S: +OK bye
DONE
